: Hi,

: I am currently attempting to finish level 3 sokoban and a peaceful co-
: aligned unicorn has lodged itself in the alley of pits I need to fill
: up, behind a boulder I was pushing. So, I am completely blocked by
: that unicorn as I cannot teleport.

: What should I do now?
: Is it better to incur a luck penalty by breaking the boulder or
: alignment penalty by killing the unicorn? Or are there any other
: options?

With a /oTeleport you can port both away, but the boulder may end in 
an unfortunate place.

If you leave the level for a long time and come back it's possible
the unicorn will fall down a hole. But that is rare.

If you have a valuable gem, throw it at the unicorn. Thus the luck
penalty is slightly reduced, sort of. ;)

I don't know offhand if polymorphing or stoneToFleshing offends 
the rules of sokoban.

